[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0792","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0792.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1095","title":"Linux modutils modprobe 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Linux modutils 2.3.x 中的 modprobe 程序在处理模块名时未正确过滤 shell 元字符，本地攻击者可通过构造特制的模块名参数注入任意 shell 命令，以 root 权限执行恶意代码。该漏洞影响 Linux 系统上使用 modutils 2.3.x 包的所有发行版，攻击者需拥有本地用户权限即可触发，无需交互，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1095"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08Z","remediation":"` tags embedded. I need to write a clean, actionable Chinese remediation.\n\nThe vulnerability is in modutils 2.3.x, specifically modprobe. The fix would be to upgrade modutils to a patched version.<value>建议升级 modutils 至 2.3.11 或更高版本。Red Hat Linux 用户可安装 RHSA-2000-108 提供的更新包；Debian 用户可安装 20001120 安全公告中的更新；SuSE 用户可参考 SuSE-SA:2000:44 安装补丁。如无法立即升级，可通过移除 /sbin/modprobe 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /sbin/modprobe）或限制本地用户对 modprobe 的调用权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0179.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q4/0596.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000340","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001120","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-071-1.php3?dis=7.1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-108.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1936","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5516","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20402","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1095.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1095.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1095","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1095.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1095.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1095.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1095.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2000/CVE-2000-1095.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1095.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1095.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0792.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0790","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0790.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1094","title":"AOL Instant Messenger BuddyIcon 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AOL Instant Messenger（AIM）4.3.2229 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当程序处理 \"buddyicon\" 命令中过长的 \"src\" 参数时，未正确校验输入长度，导致堆栈缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送特制的畸形 BuddyIcon 数据包触发该漏洞，成功利用后可导致目标系统执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 AIM 4.0、4.1.2010、4.2.1193 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商已发布 AIM 4.3.2229 版本修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1094"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:08Z","remediation":"升级 AOL Instant Messenger 至 4.3.2229 或更高版本，该版本已修复 buddyicon 命令处理中 src 参数长度校验不足导致的缓冲区溢出问题。由于 AOL 已于 2017 年 12 月 15 日停止 AIM 服务，建议立即迁移至其他即时通讯软件（如 Slack、Telegram 等）以消除安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97668265628917&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97683774417132&w=2","http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a121200-1.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/1692","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20511","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1094.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1094.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1094.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1094","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/db09292fb11e6e85f066b9d4f61163327f785736/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-1094.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1094.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1094.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1094.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1094.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2000/CVE-2000-1094.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0790.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0787","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0787.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1093","title":"AOL Instant Messenger 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AOL Instant Messenger（AIM）在 4.3.2229 之前的版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长\"goim\"命令的特制 `aim://` 链接触发该漏洞，从而在受影响系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 AIM 3.5.1856、4.0、4.1.2010、4.2.1193 等多个版本，攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户点击恶意链接即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1093"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07Z","remediation":"升级 AOL Instant Messenger 至 4.3.2229 或更高版本。该版本修复了通过畸形 \"goim\" 命令触发缓冲区溢出的问题。由于 AOL 已停止维护 AIM 服务，建议迁移至其他受支持的即时通讯软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a121200-1.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5732","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20510","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1093.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1093","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1093.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1093.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38684c3fd0857f0d63926dad0cf55972b80db69f/2000/CVE-2000-1093.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1093.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1093.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1093.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1093.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1093.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0787.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0787.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0787.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0786","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0786.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1092","title":"alex heiphetz Group EZshopper 目录遍历漏洞","description":"EZshopper 3.0 及 2.0 版本的 loadpage.cgi CGI 程序存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 file 参数中的目标文件名前插入 \"/\" 字符，绕过路径限制，实现读取 EZshopper 数据目录中的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可利用，影响运行 EZshopper 2.0 和 3.0 的 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1092"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07Z","remediation":"该产品（AHG EZshopper 2.0/3.0）已停止维护且厂商已不存在，无法通过官方补丁修复。建议立即停止使用 EZshopper，迁移至仍在维护的电子商务平台（如 Magento、WooCommerce 等）。如无法立即替换，可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置重写规则，拦截对 loadpage.cgi 的请求并返回 403；同时删除或禁用 loadpage.cgi 脚本，并对 CGI 参数中的路径遍历字符（../、/）进行严格过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97676270729984&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2109","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5740","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20507","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1092.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1092.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1092","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1092.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1092.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1092.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c3d516d6bc446725f6492ed800c677df20d0d39c/2000/CVE-2000-1092.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1092.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1092.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1092.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0786.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0786.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0786.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0785","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0785.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1089","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Phone Book 服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 的 Phone Book 服务（rasphone.exe）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以系统权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及安装了 IIS 的相关系统，CVSS v2 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-094 中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1089"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-094 提供的补丁：Windows NT 4.0 Server 需先升级至 Service Pack 6a，然后安装补丁（https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=37B1473A-33E6-446A-BD16-39B85548CCC6）；Windows 2000 Server 需升级至 Service Pack 1 后安装补丁（https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=C2EFB014-BC57-4CAF-AD28-4E3E735E1934）。如无法立即打补丁，可在 IIS 管理器中卸载 Phone Book Service（该服务默认未安装，仅当通过 NT 4 Option Pack 或 Windows 2000 可选网络组件安装后才存在风险），或通过防火墙限制对 IIS 服务器的 80 端口访问以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2048","http://www.stake.com/research/advisories/2000/a120400-1.txt","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-094","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5623","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20460","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1089.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1089.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1089.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1089","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1089.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1089.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1089.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/74a5eea2f8e7bbf8745be52f073af8f9cdbbb080/2000/CVE-2000-1089.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1089.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-10xx/CVE-2000-1089.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0785.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0783","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0783.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1085","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000/MSDE xp_peekqueue 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0/2000 及 MSDE 1.0/2000 中的 xp_peekqueue 扩展存储过程存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该函数在调用 SQL Server API 中的 srv_paraminfo 函数前未正确限制缓冲区长度，导致攻击者可通过向 xp_peekqueue 传入特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，进而造成拒绝服务或执行任意命令。攻击者需要拥有本地登录权限才能利用此漏洞，无法远程直接利用。Microsoft 至今未发布官方补丁，建议禁用不必要的扩展存储过程或限制相关权限以降低风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1085"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:07Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-092 提供的更新补丁，或升级至 SQL Server 2000 Service Pack 2 及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，可禁用不必要的扩展存储过程 xp_peekqueue 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570884410184&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2040","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20457","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1085.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1085.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1085.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1085.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1085.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1085","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1085.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1085.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1085.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1085.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0783.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0782","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0782.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1083","title":"Microsoft SQL Server xp_showcolv 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0/2000 及 Microsoft SQL Server Desktop Engine (MSDE) 1.0/2000 中的 xp_showcolv 扩展存储过程函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该函数在调用 SQL Server 扩展存储过程 API 中的 srv_paraminfo 函数之前，未正确限制缓冲区长度，导致攻击者可通过向 xp_showcolv 传递特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，进而造成服务拒绝或执行任意命令。攻击者需要具有本地登录权限才能利用此漏洞，无法远程直接利用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1083"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:06Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-092 提供的补丁：SQL Server 7.0 用户应先安装 Service Pack 2 再应用补丁（后续 SP3 已包含此修复）；SQL Server 2000 用户直接应用补丁（后续 Service Pack 1 已包含此修复）。MSDE 1.0 和 MSDE 2000 用户同样安装对应补丁。如无法安装补丁，作为临时缓解措施，可撤销对受影响扩展存储过程（xp_showcolv 等）的 EXECUTE 权限，或限制仅允许受信管理员账户连接数据库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570878710037&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2038","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20456","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1083.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1083.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1083.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1083.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1083.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1083","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1083.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1083.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1083.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1083.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0782.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0779","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0779.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1081","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 和 MSDE xp_displayparamstmt 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0/2000 及 MSDE 1.0/2000 中的扩展存储过程 API srv_paraminfo() 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该函数在解析参数时未对缓冲区长度进行有效检查，当攻击者向 xp_displayparamstmt 等扩展存储过程传递超长参数时，可触发缓冲区溢出，导致 SQL Server 服务崩溃或执行任意代码。攻击者需先通过身份认证登录 SQL Server 后方可利用此漏洞，限制了远程攻击面。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-092 中发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1081"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:06Z","remediation":"Microsoft 已在 SQL Server 2000 Service Pack 2 中修复此漏洞。建议立即升级至 SQL Server 2000 SP2 或更高版本。对于仍在使用 SQL Server 7.0 的用户，应升级至 SQL Server 2000 SP2 以上。由于 SQL Server 2000 已停止支持，强烈建议迁移至受支持的 SQL Server 版本（如 SQL Server 2019/2022）并安装最新安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在注册表中禁用不必要的扩展存储过程作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97570878710037&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2030","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-092","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A231","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20451","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1081.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1081.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1081.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-1081.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1081","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1081.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1081.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1081.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1081.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1081.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0779.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0653","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0653.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0897","title":"Max Feoktistov Small HTTP Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Max Feoktistov Small HTTP Server 2.03 及更早版本存在内存泄漏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过反复请求一个不包含 index.html 文件的目录 URL，导致服务器内存持续消耗且请求完成后无法释放，最终造成拒绝服务。攻击无需身份认证，通过网络即可触发，利用门槛低。该漏洞影响 Small HTTP Server 2.03 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0897"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-01-09T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:42Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Small HTTP Server 至 2.03 以上版本，或停止使用该已停止维护的软件，改用 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 等活跃维护的 Web 服务器。如无法升级，可在反向代理层面限制单个 IP 的请求频率作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://home.lanck.net/mf/srv/index.htm","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97421834001092&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1941","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5524","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20403","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0897.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0897.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0897","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0897.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0897.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c3d516d6bc446725f6492ed800c677df20d0d39c/2000/CVE-2000-0897.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0897.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0897.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0897.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0897.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0653.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0653.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0653.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-2100","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-2100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1149","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 Terminal Server 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 Terminal Server 的 RegAPI.DLL 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向终端服务器登录接口提交超长的用户名，触发 RegAPI.DLL 在处理登录请求时的栈缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以系统权限执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低。受影响的系统为 Windows NT 4.0 Terminal Server 版本。Microsoft 已发布安全公告 MS00-087 提供修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1149"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-01-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-087 提供的补丁（下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=74C3848B-8B3A-4151-B79D-F8FE3A2AE3AB）。如无法立即打补丁，在防火墙/路由器层面阻止外部对 TCP 端口 3389 的访问，仅允许已知可信 IP 建立终端服务连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1149.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1149.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1149","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1149.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1149.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2000/CVE-2000-1149.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1149.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1149.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1149.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1149.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-2100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1123","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1160","title":"Network Associates Sniffer Agent 3.0.10 Login 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Network Associates（NAI）Sniffer Agent 3.0.10 存在登录请求处理缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送大量登录请求，导致代理服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Sniffer Agent 3.0.10 版本，攻击者只需网络可达即可发起攻击，无需任何权限或用户交互，利用难度低。目前官方已发布相关安全公告，建议用户升级至修复版本或限制对 Sniffer Agent 管理端口的网络访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1160"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-01-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-01-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Sniffer Agent 至 3.0.10 以上版本（如 3.0.11 或更高），或在防火墙/主机上限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 Sniffer Agent 管理端口（默认 TCP 端口 9000），同时配置登录失败阈值策略，超过阈值自动临时封禁来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1160.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1160.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1160","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1160.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1160.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1160.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2000/CVE-2000-1160.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1160.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1160.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1160.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1114","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1148","title":"Volano VolanoChat Pro 权限提升漏洞","description":"tags.<value>VolanoChatPro 聊天服务器在安装时将配置文件设置为全局可读权限，并将服务器管理员密码以明文方式存储在本地的配置文件中。本地攻击者可利用此缺陷直接读取配置文件，获取管理员凭据后提升权限，从而以管理员身份控制服务器。该漏洞影响安装了 VolanoChatPro 的系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高危。攻击前提是攻击者需具备目标系统的本地访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1148"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-01-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2001-01-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 Volano Chat Server 最新版本（2.13.6）以修复明文存储管理员密码及配置文件权限过大的问题。如暂时无法升级，应立即修改 VolanoChatPro 安装目录下配置文件的权限为仅管理员可读写（chmod 600），将配置文件中明文保存的管理员密码替换为加密哈希值，并限制服务器本地非授权用户的访问权限。临时缓解措施还包括禁用本地用户登录或通过防火墙限制管理端口的远程访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1148.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1148.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1148","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1148.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1148.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6b33754436807963644c2d5992bc8ca82f7c9f07/2000/CVE-2000-1148.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/04ded07645d3d1d1ff4bc7fdbd85d7a922796dcd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-11xx/CVE-2000-1148.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/63bc6ccb7d9e7d0447e23eb842c0b23beddd261c/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1148.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1148.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1148.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-2206","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-2206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1242","title":"American Power Conversion PowerChute 默认凭据未授权访问漏洞","description":"American Power Conversion (APC) PowerChute 的 HTTP 服务存在默认凭据漏洞，未对管理员账户进行强制密码修改提示。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 Web 界面使用预设的默认用户名和密码登录系统，进而获取管理员权限。该漏洞影响部署了 APC PowerChute 电源管理软件的服务器及网络设备，攻击者可利用默认凭据控制 UPS 管理接口，导致未经授权的系统访问和配置篡改，严重时可中断关键业务系统的电力管理。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1242"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:27Z","remediation":"请立即升级 APC PowerChute到最新版本，删除默认管理员凭据。编辑<code>/opt/apcps/etc/passwd</code>文件，移除<code>admin</code>用户的默认密码或设置强密码；同时更新<code>/opt/apcps/etc/web.conf</code>配置文件，禁用HTTP Basic Auth认证，建议对Web管理端口进行防火墙限制，仅开放内部网络访问。通过SNMP community string强制变更，使用强密码策略（包含大小写字母、数字、特殊字符），并在每台设备上启用日志记录审计功能记录所有登录尝试，定期监控安全日志以检测异常访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://governmentsecurity.org/articles/DefaultLoginsandPasswordsforNetworkedDevices.php","http://www.osvdb.org/30768","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1242.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1242.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1242","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1242.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1242.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1242.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ed0864e87bec515a12f89ab060c3cbb0a6a56af5/2000/CVE-2000-1242.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1242.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1242.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1242.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-2206.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-2206.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-2206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-2200","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-2200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1241","title":"Haakon Nilsen SIPS 内容发布系统未指定安全漏洞","description":"Haakon Nilsen 开发的简单集成发布系统（SIPS）0.2.4 及之前版本存在严重安全缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络直接发起利用，完全获取系统的机密性、完整性和可用性控制权。该漏洞 CVSS 评分满分 10.0，危害等级为严重，影响所有部署了受影响版本 SIPS 的网站服务器。攻击者利用该漏洞可执行任意代码或完全接管目标系统，建议用户立即升级至 0.2.4 或更高版本进行修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1241"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:26Z","remediation":"立即将 SIPS 升级至 0.3.1 或更高版本以彻底修复该严重安全漏洞。如暂时无法升级，建议临时下线该系统或限制其网络访问权限，并在 Web 服务器层面配置 IP 访问控制列表，仅允许可信地址访问该应用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sourceforge.net/forum/forum.php?forum_id=25971","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1241.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1241.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1241","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1241.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1241.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1241.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ed0864e87bec515a12f89ab060c3cbb0a6a56af5/2000/CVE-2000-1241.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1241.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/3c4d7392fa5965a157cd052f4789036ef0f7ddd6/api/2000/CVE-2000-1241.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1241.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-2200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-2198","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-2198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1239","title":"IBM Tivoli Management Framework 安全绕过漏洞","description":"IBM Tivoli Management Framework 3.7.1 中的 Tivoli Lightweight Client Framework (LCF) 存在安全绕过漏洞。该组件的 HTTP 接口在安装时默认将 http_disable 参数设置为零（即启用状态），远程已认证用户可通过操纵日志文件的方式绕过 Tivoli Endpoint Configuration 数据文件的访问权限限制，从而未经授权读取或修改敏感配置文件。该漏洞影响 IBM Tivoli Management Framework 3.7.1 版本，攻击者需通过身份认证后方可利用，利用方式涉及对日志文件进行未明确说明的操纵操作。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1239"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:26Z","remediation":"升级 IBM Tivoli Management Framework 至已修复此漏洞的版本，并确认 Tivoli Lightweight Client Framework (LCF) 的 http_disable 参数已设置为 1（禁用 HTTP 接口），可通过修改 lcf.cfg 配置文件或在 Tivoli 管理控制台中将 HTTP 服务设置为禁用状态实现。同时建议在防火墙层限制对 LCF 管理端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理主机连接，并检查 Tivoli Endpoint Configuration 数据文件的权限设置，确保普通用户无法通过 HTTP 接口读取或修改敏感配置文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www-1.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21082896","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/17085","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3927","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1239.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1239.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1239","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1239.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1239.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1239.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/25203fd38febf163b5a0afeecde6a3effc609cec/2000/CVE-2000-1239.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/b